      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXI GRIN (8) flew the lids from the middle with an impressive turn of foot, going on to clock 29.73 when a 1.1 lengths winner over 515m at Sandown. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to his name from seven starts. Ideally placed to take this out. ASTON BARRISTER (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (28.33) in a Restricted WIN H at Bendigo latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. PAW QUIVER (4) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 525m behind Dash Parr (30.71) in a Grade 4/5. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. OPAWA SCOOTER (3) was in the money last start in fast time and should feature again.",
